#: app/templates/landing.html:493
msgid "Coordinate field campaigns"
msgstr "Koordinasikan kampanye lapangan"

#: app/templates/landing.html:496
msgid ""
"Enhancing field mapping efficiency and accuracy through seamless "
"coordination."
msgstr ""
"Meningkatkan efisiensi dan akurasi pemetaan lapangan melalui koordinasi "
"yang mulus."

#: app/templates/landing.html:500
msgid "Explore Projects"
msgstr "Jelajahi Proyek"

#: app/templates/landing.html:513
msgid "Loading metrics..."
msgstr "Memuat metrik..."

#: app/templates/landing.html:521
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "Apa ini?"

#: app/templates/landing.html:523
msgid ""
"The Field Tasking Manager (Field-TM) helps teams add local knowledge to "
"map features\n"
"        by coordinating mapping in the field."
msgstr ""
"Field Tasking Manager (Field-TM) membantu tim menambahkan pengetahuan "
"lokal ke fitur peta dengan mengoordinasikan pemetaan di lapangan."

#: app/templates/landing.html:527
msgid ""
"Field-TM facilitates collaborative mapping by supporting and extending "
"mature tools\n"
"        like ODK and QField. It is a standalone mobile and web workflow "
"that helps teams collect\n"
"        geospatial data efficiently with commonly available Android "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Field-TM memfasilitasi pemetaan kolaboratif dengan mendukung dan "
"memperluas alat matang seperti ODK dan QField. Ini adalah alur kerja "
"seluler dan web mandiri yang membantu tim mengumpulkan data geospasial "
"secara efisien dengan perangkat Android yang umum tersedia."

#: app/templates/landing.html:534
msgid "A project manager demonstrates FieldTM mapping workflow on a laptop"
msgstr ""
"Seorang manajer proyek mendemonstrasikan alur kerja pemetaan FieldTM di "
"laptop"

#: app/templates/landing.html:540
msgid "Main Features"
msgstr "Fitur Utama"

#: app/templates/landing.html:543
msgid "Flexible Data Collection"
msgstr "Pengumpulan Data Fleksibel"

#: app/templates/landing.html:545
msgid ""
"Support diverse survey forms, multiple data formats, and adaptable "
"workflows that\n"
"          fit different operational needs."
msgstr ""
"Mendukung beragam formulir survei, berbagai format data, dan alur kerja "
"yang dapat disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan operasional yang berbeda."

#: app/templates/landing.html:550
msgid "Open Source and Customizable"
msgstr "Sumber Terbuka dan Dapat Disesuaikan"

#: app/templates/landing.html:552
msgid ""
"Adapt Field-TM to your own survey logic, data structures, and integration"
"\n"
"          requirements."
msgstr ""
"Sesuaikan Field-TM dengan logika survei, struktur data, dan kebutuhan "
"integrasi Anda sendiri."

#: app/templates/landing.html:557
msgid "Entity-Level Tracking"
msgstr "Pelacakan Tingkat Entitas"

#: app/templates/landing.html:559
msgid ""
"Monitor survey progress at task and feature level so managers can make "
"informed\n"
"          decisions quickly."
msgstr ""
"Pantau kemajuan survei pada tingkat tugas dan fitur sehingga manajer "
"dapat membuat keputusan berdasarkan informasi dengan cepat."

#: app/templates/landing.html:567
msgid "Who is it for?"
msgstr "Untuk siapa ini?"

#: app/templates/landing.html:570
msgid "Project Manager"
msgstr "Manajer Proyek"

#: app/templates/landing.html:571
msgid "Create and coordinate field campaigns"
msgstr "Membuat dan mengoordinasikan kampanye lapangan"

#: app/templates/landing.html:573
msgid ""
"Project managers use Field-TM to set up mapping projects, define areas of"
" interest,\n"
"          design survey forms, and split work into manageable tasks."
msgstr ""
"Manajer proyek menggunakan Field-TM untuk menyiapkan proyek pemetaan, "
"menentukan area minat, merancang formulir survei, dan membagi pekerjaan "
"menjadi tugas-tugas yang dapat dikelola."

#: app/templates/landing.html:577
msgid "Define a project area and upload or choose a survey form"
msgstr "Tentukan area proyek dan unggah atau pilih formulir survei"

#: app/templates/landing.html:578
msgid "Split the area into tasks and generate a data extract"
msgstr "Bagi area menjadi tugas dan hasilkan ekstrak data"

#: app/templates/landing.html:579
msgid "Publish the project to ODK Central or QFieldCloud"
msgstr "Publikasikan proyek ke ODK Central atau QFieldCloud"

#: app/templates/landing.html:580
msgid "Share a QR code so mappers can start collecting data"
msgstr "Bagikan kode QR agar pemeta dapat mulai mengumpulkan data"

#: app/templates/landing.html:584
msgid "Field Mapper"
msgstr "Pemeta Lapangan"

#: app/templates/landing.html:585
msgid "Collect data in the field with your phone"
msgstr "Kumpulkan data di lapangan dengan ponsel Anda"

#: app/templates/landing.html:587
msgid ""
"Mappers do not need to log in to Field-TM. Once a project manager "
"publishes a\n"
"          project, mappers access it directly in their mobile app of "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"Pemeta tidak perlu masuk ke Field-TM. Setelah manajer proyek "
"mempublikasikan proyek, pemeta dapat mengaksesnya langsung di aplikasi "
"seluler pilihan mereka."

#: app/templates/landing.html:591
msgid "Scan the QR code shared by your project manager"
msgstr "Pindai kode QR yang dibagikan oleh manajer proyek Anda"

#: app/templates/landing.html:592
msgid "The project loads automatically in ODK Collect or QField"
msgstr "Proyek dimuat secara otomatis di ODK Collect atau QField"

#: app/templates/landing.html:593
msgid "Navigate to your assigned task area and collect data"
msgstr "Arahkan ke area tugas yang ditugaskan dan kumpulkan data"

#: app/templates/landing.html:594
msgid "Submit your survey, which goes straight to the server"
msgstr "Kirim survei Anda, yang langsung masuk ke server"

#: app/templates/landing.html:601
msgid "Field-TM Use Cases"
msgstr "Contoh Penggunaan Field-TM"

#: app/templates/landing.html:606
msgid "Field mapping in progress"
msgstr "Pemetaan lapangan sedang berlangsung"

#: app/templates/landing.html:611
msgid "1. Community Mapping"
msgstr "1. Pemetaan Komunitas"

#: app/templates/landing.html:613
msgid ""
"Field Tasking Manager empowers communities to map informal settlements, "
"public\n"
"            facilities, and local services for inclusive planning."
msgstr ""
"Field Tasking Manager memberdayakan komunitas untuk memetakan permukiman "
"informal, fasilitas publik, dan layanan lokal demi perencanaan yang "
"inklusif."

#: app/templates/landing.html:618
msgid "2. Urban Planning and Management"
msgstr "2. Perencanaan dan Pengelolaan Kota"

#: app/templates/landing.html:620
msgid ""
"Build smarter cities with coordinated surveys of houses, roads, and "
"utilities\n"
"            through clear, manageable mapping tasks."
msgstr ""
"Bangun kota yang lebih cerdas dengan survei rumah, jalan, dan utilitas "
"yang terkoordinasi melalui tugas pemetaan yang jelas dan mudah dikelola."

#: app/templates/landing.html:625
msgid "3. Disaster Response and Recovery"
msgstr "3. Tanggap dan Pemulihan Bencana"

#: app/templates/landing.html:627
msgid ""
"Rapidly map damaged infrastructure after disasters, coordinate "
"volunteers, and\n"
"            deliver reliable data for relief operations."
msgstr ""
"Petakan infrastruktur yang rusak dengan cepat setelah bencana, "
"koordinasikan relawan, dan sediakan data yang andal untuk operasi "
"bantuan."

#: app/templates/landing.html:636
msgid "Resources"
msgstr "Sumber Daya"

#: app/templates/landing.html:644
msgid "Data Prep"
msgstr "Persiapan Data"

#: app/templates/landing.html:645
msgid "HOT Export Tool"
msgstr "Alat Ekspor HOT"

#: app/templates/landing.html:647
msgid "Download task-ready geospatial data extracts for your project area."
msgstr "Unduh ekstrak data geospasial yang siap tugas untuk area proyek Anda."

